ilot Studio、GitHub Copilot app 和 CLI 等产品。","title":"Microsoft 通过 Foundry 开放 Copilot harness，支持多模型 Agent 开发","title_en":"Introducing the Microsoft Copilot harness: Unlocking the potential of truly multi-model agentic work","url":"https://blogs.microsoft.com/blog/2026/10/28/introducing-the-microsoft-copilot-harness-unlocking-the-potential-of-truly-multi-model-agentic-work/"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/xonc43xgcx39303i40k8022rl","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"xonc43xgcx39303i40k8022rl","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/xonc43xgcx39303i40k8022rl","published_at":"2026-10-28T16:09:28Z","ref":"A10","score":71,"selected":true,"source":"GitHub Blog","summary":"GitHub 在 GitHub Universe 2026 上提出把 GitHub 打造为完整软件交付系统的愿景，并发布多项产品：GitHub Copilot app 面向智能体交付。","title":"GitHub Universe 2026 发布 GitHub Copilot app、Copilot Fusion 等智能体产品","title_en":"GitHub Universe 2026: Evolving every layer of the stack","url":"https://github.blog/news-insights/company-news/github-universe-2026-evolving-every-layer-of-the-stack/"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/s3m3uzabqoxxed9ae50b73qvc","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"s3m3uzabqoxxed9ae50b73qvc","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/s3m3uzabqoxxed9ae50b73qvc","published_at":"2026-10-28T16:07:40Z","ref":"A11","score":78,"selected":true,"source":"GitHub Blog","summary":"GitHub 发布 2026 年度 Octoverse 报告：过去 12 个月开发者推送代码 179 亿次，超过 2024 和 2025 年之和，合并 PR 达 13 亿次。","title":"GitHub Octoverse 2026：开发活动创新高，超 40% 的 PR 由智能体起草","title_en":"Octoverse: Commits, pushes, reach new highs in 2026 as developers build with agents","url":"https://github.blog/news-insights/octoverse/octoverse-commits-pushes-reach-new-highs-in-2026-as-developers-build-with-agents/"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/ja57b43t7h52wid2g4zu6vw2t","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"opinion","id":"ja57b43t7h52wid2g4zu6vw2t","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/ja57b43t7h52wid2g4zu6vw2t","published_at"